{"id":"b15595c6868517ce","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-continuous-discrete-actions.md","title":"Definition — 拓扑群的连续离散作用与开稳定子","display":"Definition — 拓扑群的连续离散作用与开稳定子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-continuous-discrete-actions","aliases":["14-df-continuous-discrete-actions"],"display":"Definition — 拓扑群的连续离散作用与开稳定子","source_ref":"I.1, p.28; I, Exercise 6(a–b), pp.62–63; III.9, pp.150–155","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-algebraic-structures]]","[[14-df-right-group-actions]]","[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-continuous-discrete-actions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-continuous-discrete-actions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 拓扑群的连续离散作用与开稳定子"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.1, p.28; I, Exercise 6(a–b), pp.62–63; III.9, pp.150–155"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4d1aca1534bd822e\" href=\"?note=4d1aca1534bd822e\" title=\"14-df-algebraic-structures\">14-df-algebraic-structures</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ff1dddefb4838916\" href=\"?note=ff1dddefb4838916\" title=\"14-df-right-group-actions\">14-df-right-group-actions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(G\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G\">\\(\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4d1aca1534bd822e\" href=\"?note=4d1aca1534bd822e\" title=\"14-df-algebraic-structures\">14-df-algebraic-structures</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsTopologicalGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G)\">\\(\\operatorname{IsTopologicalGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 在本原子中表示右 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 作用的底集且取离散拓扑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\rho_X)\">\\((X,\\rho_X)\\)</span> 才是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ff1dddefb4838916\" href=\"?note=ff1dddefb4838916\" title=\"14-df-right-group-actions\">14-df-right-group-actions</a> 的作用对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_G\">\\(\\tau_G\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的拓扑。乘积拓扑由矩形基给出。稳定子依赖于当前作用对象，精确记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_x\">\\(G_x\\)</span> 是该参数已绑定时的简称。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}\">\\(BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\)</span> 为以下定义的满子范畴候选；满子范畴构造见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{X\\times G}=\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\mid\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\{B\\times O\\mid B\\subseteq X\\land O\\in\\tau_G\\}\\},\\qquad C(X\\times G,X)=\\{f:X\\times G\\to X\\mid\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;f^{-1}(B)\\in\\tau_{X\\times G}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_{X\\times G}=\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\mid\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\{B\\times O\\mid B\\subseteq X\\land O\\in\\tau_G\\}\\},\\qquad C(X\\times G,X)=\\{f:X\\times G\\to X\\mid\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;f^{-1}(B)\\in\\tau_{X\\times G}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)=\\{g\\in G\\mid\\rho_X(x,g)=x\\},\\qquad X_{\\mathrm{cts}}=\\{x\\in X\\mid \\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)\\in\\tau_G\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)=\\{g\\in G\\mid\\rho_X(x,g)=x\\},\\qquad X_{\\mathrm{cts}}=\\{x\\in X\\mid \\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)\\in\\tau_G\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}=\\operatorname{FullSubcat}\\left(BG,\\{(X,\\rho_X)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(BG)\\mid\\forall x\\in X\\;\\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)\\in\\tau_G\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}=\\operatorname{FullSubcat}\\left(BG,\\{(X,\\rho_X)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(BG)\\mid\\forall x\\in X\\;\\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)\\in\\tau_G\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_X\\in C(X\\times G,X)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)\\in\\tau_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_X\\in C(X\\times G,X)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)\\in\\tau_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若作用连续，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{x\\}\\times G_x\">\\(\\{x\\}\\times G_x\\)</span> 是点纤维在开片 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{x\\}\\times G\">\\(\\{x\\}\\times G\\)</span> 内的逆像，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_x\">\\(G_x\\)</span> 开。反之每个轨道映射的纤维为稳定子的陪集，均开；离散的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 使整个作用按开片 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{x\\}\\times G\">\\(\\{x\\}\\times G\\)</span> 分解，故连续。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{xg}=g^{-1}G_xg\">\\(G_{xg}=g^{-1}G_xg\\)</span>，所以具有开稳定子的点组成作用稳定子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\mathrm{cts}}\">\\(X_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\)</span>，不需要另加稳定性假设。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.1, p.28; I, Exercise 6(a–b), pp.62–63; III.9, pp.150–155。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-algebraic-structures","status":"resolved","id":"4d1aca1534bd822e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-algebraic-structures]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-right-group-actions","status":"resolved","id":"ff1dddefb4838916","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-right-group-actions]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"1601eff2507fda14","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-algebraic-structures","status":"resolved","id":"4d1aca1534bd822e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\in\\mathcal U$ 及 $\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G$ 满足 [[14-df-algebraic-structures]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsTopologicalGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G)$；$