igcup\\mathcal A\\mid\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\{B\\times O\\mid B\\subseteq X\\land O\\in\\tau_G\\}\\},\\qquad C(X\\times G,X)=\\{f:X\\times G\\to X\\mid\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;f^{-1}(B)\\in\\tau_{X\\times G}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)=\\{g\\in G\\mid\\rho_X(x,g)=x\\},\\qquad X_{\\mathrm{cts}}=\\{x\\in X\\mid \\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)\\in\\tau_G\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}=\\operatorname{FullSubcat}\\left(BG,\\{(X,\\rho_X)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(BG)\\mid\\forall x\\in X\\;\\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)\\in\\tau_G\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho_X\\in C(X\\times G,X)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)\\in\\tau_G).","display":true},{"tex":"\\{x\\}\\times G_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\{x\\}\\times G","display":false},{"tex":"G_x","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\{x\\}\\times G","display":false},{"tex":"G_{xg}=g^{-1}G_xg","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\mathrm{cts}}","display":false}],"bytes":2604,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-300","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions|df-207 — 拓扑群的连续离散作用与开稳定子]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions|df-207 — 拓扑群的连续离散作用与开稳定子]]"},{"id":"bbce3cb75d3e9dbc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$G,\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G$ 沿用 [[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions]] 的拓扑群数据。$i:BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\to BG$ 为满包含。$X=(|X|,\\rho_X)$、$X'=(|X'|,\\rho_{X'})$ 为任意带作用对象，$f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(X,X')$；$b_G$ 见 [[14-df-right-group-actions]]。$X_{\\mathrm{cts}}$ 为下式定义的子集，稳定子精确签名见 [[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions]]。$r$ 是以下定义的函子。$W,Y,Z$ 为连续作用对象，$(-)^{(-)}_{BG}$ 采用 [[14-df-group-action-exponentials]] 的带结构指数。$\\iota_X:X_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\hookrightarrow|X|$ 为集合包含函数；$v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(iY,X)$、$k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}(Y,rX)$。"}],"outgoing":["4d1aca1534bd822e","ff1dddefb4838916","1601eff2507fda14"]}